230
00:08:51,236 --> 00:08:53,338
Then comes the Thunderball pair.

231
00:08:53,518 --> 00:08:56,568
Ecurie says Eon ordered two more DB5s

232
00:08:56,568 --> 00:09:00,606
for Thunderball: chassis two thousand eight slash

233
00:09:00,606 --> 00:09:02,255
R, the featured car,

234
00:09:02,255 --> 00:09:05,139
and two thousand seventeen slash R.

235
00:09:05,319 --> 00:09:08,804
Both had Adam's modifications installed by Aston

236
00:09:08,804 --> 00:09:10,692
Martin to work repeatedly,

237
00:09:10,692 --> 00:09:13,015
and they were sent to the United

238
00:09:13,015 --> 00:09:14,903
States, one to each coast,

239
00:09:14,903 --> 00:09:15,919
