245
00:09:30,061 --> 00:09:30,381
a U.

246
00:09:30,561 --> 00:09:30,945
S.

247
00:09:31,125 --> 00:09:33,945
tour promoting Thunderball and has had three

248
00:09:33,945 --> 00:09:35,676
owners in over fifty years.

249
00:09:35,856 --> 00:09:39,570
Old Cars Weekly says the same car,

250
00:09:39,570 --> 00:09:43,831
2008/R, is one of three surviving James

251
00:09:43,831 --> 00:09:44,923
Bond DB5s.

252
00:09:45,273 --> 00:09:46,772
That car's journey:

253
00:09:46,772 --> 00:09:48,271
Ecurie says Danjaq,

254
00:09:48,271 --> 00:09:50,006
Eon's Swiss financier,

255
00:09:50,006 --> 00:09:52,925
offered the cars for sale in nineteen

256
00:09:52,925 --> 00:09:56,396
