257
00:09:56,576 --> 00:09:56,796
B.

258
00:09:56,976 --> 00:09:57,243
H.

259
00:09:57,423 --> 00:10:00,883
Atchley of the Smokey Mountain Car Museum

260
00:10:00,883 --> 00:10:03,667
in Tennessee later bought 2008/R,

261
00:10:03,667 --> 00:10:07,127
