264
00:10:10,850 --> 00:10:13,855
RM Auctions offered it in two thousand

265
00:10:13,855 --> 00:10:14,171
six.

266
00:10:14,520 --> 00:10:15,751
Then the restoration.

267
00:10:15,931 --> 00:10:19,682
Roos Engineering in Switzerland restored the car,

268
00:10:19,682 --> 00:10:23,279
