273
00:10:32,348 --> 00:10:34,945
RM Sotheby's sold it for six million

274
00:10:34,945 --> 00:10:38,048
three hundred eighty-five thousand dollars.

275
00:10:38,228 --> 00:10:40,363
Six parties bid over four and a

276
00:10:40,363 --> 00:10:41,258
half minutes.

277
00:10:41,608 --> 00:10:43,856
CNN, covering the same sale,

278
00:10:43,856 --> 00:10:46,907
gives the pre-sale estimate as four to

279
00:10:46,907 --> 00:10:48,513
